# Roadmap execution

Read `docs/roadmap.md` before implementing a phase.

| Phase | Focus |
|---|---|
| 1 | Expo scaffold, tokens, boot |
| 2 | Zod, TMDB client, query hooks |
| 3 | Zustand session, theme, lists |
| 4 | Screen-for-screen UI parity |
| 5 | Android API 24, 29, 33, 36, plus one physical phone |
| 6 | Comprehension timing and written decision |

## Rules

1. Do not skip a validation gate.
2. Phase 5 needs a killed-app run of cases D-01 through D-12 on each slot. A pass on one emulator does not cover the others.
3. API 24 and API 36 failures block the decision phase.
4. Phase 6 records the scores. It does not choose React Native or PWA for the team.
5. Scaffold into a temp directory. This folder already holds `docs/` and `.cursor/`.
